== Description ==
Demo Your Work is a showcase plugin for WordPress Elementor Page Builder. It's a Mac manitor when you hover, scroll up the selected image.

= Check out Demos =
* [Demo Your Work Plugin - Main Demo](https://chamrundigital.com.my/demo-your-work-wordpress-plugin)



== Installation ==
Note : This plugin works with Elementor. Make sure you have [Elementor](https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementor/) installed.

1. Upload the plugin folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the Plugins screen in WordPress
3. You can type \"Demo Your Work on your element tabs within Elementor editor and all the Woocommerce element will appear.
4. Done! Enjoy :)


